Consistency$^{\mathrm{c}}$ (form-free) & $0.151$ & $0.147$ & $0.57$--$0.64$ \\
Label-free prior & $0.171$ & $0.172$ & $0.653$ \\
Grounded prior & $0.166$ & $0.156$ & $0.525$ \\
